title BUILTIN Node — Queued Mode\n<size:10><color:#BB0000>Red arrows = ASYNC (queue handoff)</color> | <color:#354A5F>Dark arrows = SYNC</color> — **No recursion**: each node is a separate queue action</size>

participant "OrchestrationWorker" as worker SAP_RED
participant "OrchestrationQueue" as queue SAP_RED
participant "OrchestrationEngine" as engine SAP_BLUE
participant "NodeHandler" as handler SAP_GREEN
participant "EventPublisher" as pub SAP_NAVY

== ASYNC: Worker dequeues action ==

worker -[#BB0000]>> queue : dequeue()
activate worker
activate queue
queue --> worker : ExecuteNodeAction(run_id, task_id)
deactivate queue

== SYNC: Engine processes single node (under run lock) ==

worker -> engine : orchestrate_execute_node(run_id, task_id)
activate engine

engine -> engine : Acquire run lock
engine -> engine : Predecessor-readiness guard (Fix B)\n  **SYNC check** — defers if predecessors not done

engine -> engine : _exec_builtin_queued(task, node, run, ...)

engine -> engine : Buffer task.dispatched event

engine -> handler : invoke_handler(node, run, ...,\ncurrent_scope_stack=task.scope_stack)
activate handler
note over handler
  **SYNC** — same as inline mode.
  Handler runs, returns result.
end note
handler --> engine : NodeHandlerResult
deactivate handler

engine -> engine : Apply state_updates
engine -> engine : Mark task COMPLETED

group ASYNC successor dispatch [For each successor — enqueued, NOT recursed]
  engine -[#BB0000]> queue : enqueue(ExecuteNodeAction)\n**[ASYNC: each successor is a\nseparate queue action]**
  activate queue
  note right of queue #FFF0E0
    **KEY DIFFERENCE from inline:**
    Successors are NOT executed now.
    They will be dequeued and processed
    independently by the worker.
  end note
  deactivate queue
end

engine -> pub : publish events (SYNC)
activate pub
deactivate pub

engine -> engine : maybe_enqueue_loop_iteration(task, run)\n  **SYNC** — if inside loop body, may enqueue\n  LoopIterationAction (ASYNC)
engine -> engine : Save run
engine -> engine : check_run_completion()

deactivate engine
deactivate worker

== ~~~ ASYNC BOUNDARY ~~~ (successor processed in next worker cycle) ==

... Worker dequeues next ExecuteNodeAction ...

@enduml


