title TASK Node — Worker Dispatch & Completion\n<size:10><color:#BB0000>Red = ASYNC</color> | <color:#354A5F>Dark = SYNC</color> — **Two ASYNC boundaries**: dispatch to worker + completion callback</size>

participant "OrchestrationEngine" as engine SAP_BLUE
participant "VariableResolver" as vr SAP_GREEN
participant "EventPublisher" as pub SAP_NAVY
participant "WorkerExecutor\n(port 8004)" as executor SAP_GOLD
participant "Worker\n(HTTP/Agent/Wait)" as worker SAP_GOLD
participant "CompleteTaskUseCase" as ctuc SAP_BLUE
participant "OrchestrationQueue" as queue SAP_RED

== SYNC: Dispatch Phase (engine call stack) ==

engine -> engine : dispatch_or_handle_task(task)\n[TASK branch]
activate engine

engine -> vr : resolve(node.input_binding)
activate vr
note over vr
  **SYNC** — resolves $.node_id.field
  expressions from run.context.variables.
  May call file service (async I/O but
  same call stack via await).
end note
vr --> engine : resolved_input
deactivate vr

engine -> engine : Convert to CSV if needed
engine -> engine : Mark task RUNNING
engine -> engine : Record stage

engine -> pub : task.dispatched (IMMEDIATE, published now)
activate pub
deactivate pub

engine -[#BB0000]> executor : dispatch task (HTTP POST)\n**[ASYNC BOUNDARY #1]**
note right of executor #FFF0E0
  **Engine returns here.**
  Task is now owned by the
  worker-executor service.
  Engine call stack ends.
end note

deactivate engine

== ~~~ ASYNC BOUNDARY #1 ~~~ (task executes on external worker) ==

... Worker-executor routes to registered worker ...

executor -> worker : POST /api/v1/execute
activate executor
activate worker
note over worker
  **Worker runs independently**
  (HTTP request, AI agent call,
  wait timer, data mapping, etc.)
  Duration: milliseconds to hours.
end note
worker --> executor : result (output data)
deactivate worker
deactivate executor

== ~~~ ASYNC BOUNDARY #2 ~~~ (completion callback to control plane) ==

executor -[#BB0000]> ctuc : POST /api/v1/complete-task\n(run_id, task_id, output)\n**[ASYNC BOUNDARY #2]**

== SYNC: Completion Phase (use case call stack) ==

activate ctuc

ctuc -> ctuc : Mark task COMPLETED
ctuc -> ctuc : Apply output_mapping / output_binding
ctuc -> ctuc : Store output as CSV file
ctuc -> ctuc : Update run.context.variables

ctuc -> pub : task.completed (SYNC publish)
activate pub
deactivate pub

ctuc -> pub : context.updated (SYNC publish)
activate pub
deactivate pub

ctuc -> ctuc : maybe_enqueue_loop_iteration(task, run)\n  **SYNC** — may enqueue LoopIterationAction

ctuc -[#BB0000]> queue : enqueue(ContinueRunAction)\n**[ASYNC: successor processing\nhappens in next worker cycle]**
activate queue
deactivate queue

deactivate ctuc

== ~~~ ASYNC BOUNDARY #3 ~~~ (successor processing via queue) ==

... Worker dequeues ContinueRunAction ...
note over engine
  orchestrate_continue(run_id, task_id)
  -> process_and_dispatch_successors
  -> enqueue next node actions
end note

@enduml


